@startuml 05-uml-despliegue

' Bank USAC - UML 2 Deployment Diagram
' The Kubernetes stereotypes are a project-specific UML profile extension.

title UML 2 - Diagrama de Despliegue\nBank USAC

left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam wrapWidth 220
skinparam maxMessageSize 180
skinparam ArrowColor #555555
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.2
skinparam NodeBorderThickness 1.5
skinparam ArtifactBorderThickness 1.3
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
skinparam noteBorderColor #D6B656

skinparam node {
    BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    BorderColor #1168BD
    FontColor #1168BD
}
skinparam node<<device>> {
    BackgroundColor #F7F7F7
    BorderColor #C11926
    FontColor #C11926
}
skinparam node<<executionEnvironment>> {
    BackgroundColor #F4F8FF
    BorderColor #1168BD
    FontColor #1168BD
}
skinparam node<<kubernetesDeployment>> {
    BackgroundColor #FFF8EE
    BorderColor #EF9425
    FontColor #EF9425
}
skinparam node<<kubernetesService>> {
    BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    BorderColor #1168BD
    FontColor #1168BD
}
skinparam node<<kubernetesNamespace>> {
    BackgroundColor #EAF2FF
    BorderColor #1168BD
    FontColor #1168BD
}
skinparam artifact {
    BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    BorderColor #398819
    FontColor #398819
}
skinparam artifact<<secret>> {
    BackgroundColor #FFF0F0
    BorderColor #C11926
    FontColor #C11926
}

legend right
    |= Element | Notación |
    | <color:#C11926>Rojo</color> | Host o infraestructura externa al clúster |
    | <color:#1168BD>Azul</color> | Nodo, namespace, service o conectividad de Kubernetes |
    | <color:#EF9425>Naranja</color> | Deployment y Pod de una aplicación |
    | <color:#398819>Verde</color> | Artifact: imagen, ConfigMap o chart |
    | Línea sólida | Asociación / communication path |
    | Línea discontinua | Dependency: `<<deploy>>` o referencia de configuración en tiempo de ejecución |
    | `<<device>>` | Recurso físico o virtual de cómputo |
    | `<<executionEnvironment>>` | Entorno donde se ejecutan artefactos |
    | `<<kubernetesDeployment>>`, `<<kubernetesService>>`, `<<kubernetesNamespace>>` | Extensiones del perfil Kubernetes del proyecto |
endlegend

node "Developer Host" as host <<device>> #F7F7F7 {
    node "Docker Engine" as docker <<executionEnvironment>> #FFF0F0 {
        node "RabbitMQ\nRabbitMQ 4.3.4-management" as rabbitmq <<node>> #FFF0F0 {
            artifact "rabbitmq:4.3.4-management" as rabbit_image
        }

        node "Customer DB\nPostgreSQL 18.4" as customer_db <<node>> #FFF0F0 {
            artifact "postgres:18.4" as customer_db_image
        }
        node "Account DB\nPostgreSQL 18.4" as account_db <<node>> #FFF0F0 {
            artifact "postgres:18.4" as account_db_image
        }
        node "Transaction DB\nPostgreSQL 18.4" as transaction_db <<node>> #FFF0F0 {
            artifact "postgres:18.4" as transaction_db_image
        }
        node "Payment DB\nPostgreSQL 18.4" as payment_db <<node>> #FFF0F0 {
            artifact "postgres:18.4" as payment_db_image
        }
        node "Notification DB\nPostgreSQL 18.4" as notification_db <<node>> #FFF0F0 {
            artifact "postgres:18.4" as notification_db_image
        }
        node "MinIO\nS3-compatible object store" as minio <<node>> #FFF0F0 {
            artifact "minio/minio:RELEASE.2024-11-07T00-52-20Z" as minio_image
        }
    }

    node "kind cluster\nSingle-node local limitation" as kind <<node>> #EAF2FF {
        node "kind-worker" as worker <<device>> #F7F7F7 {
            node "Namespace: bank-usac" as namespace <<kubernetesNamespace>> #EAF2FF {
                node "frontend" as dep_frontend <<kubernetesDeployment>> #FFF8EE {
                    node "frontend-pod" as pod_frontend <<executionEnvironment>> #FFF8EE {
                        artifact "bank-usac/frontend:<git-sha>\nNuxt 4" as image_frontend
                    }
                }
                node "gateway" as dep_gateway <<kubernetesDeployment>> #FFF8EE {
                    node "gateway-pod" as pod_gateway <<executionEnvironment>> #FFF8EE {
                        artifact "bank-usac/gateway:<git-sha>\nNestJS" as image_gateway
                    }
                }
                node "customer" as dep_customer <<kubernetesDeployment>> #FFF8EE {
                    node "customer-pod" as pod_customer <<executionEnvironment>> #FFF8EE {
                        artifact "bank-usac/customer:<git-sha>\nNestJS" as image_customer
                    }
                }
                node "account" as dep_account <<kubernetesDeployment>> #FFF8EE {
                    node "account-pod" as pod_account <<executionEnvironment>> #FFF8EE {
                        artifact "bank-usac/account:<git-sha>\nNestJS" as image_account
                    }
                }
                node "transaction" as dep_transaction <<kubernetesDeployment>> #FFF8EE {
                    node "transaction-pod" as pod_transaction <<executionEnvironment>> #FFF8EE {
                        artifact "bank-usac/transaction:<git-sha>\nNestJS" as image_transaction
                    }
                }
                node "payment" as dep_payment <<kubernetesDeployment>> #FFF8EE {
                    node "payment-pod" as pod_payment <<executionEnvironment>> #FFF8EE {
                        artifact "bank-usac/payment:<git-sha>\nNestJS" as image_payment
                    }
                }
                node "notification-audit" as dep_notification <<kubernetesDeployment>> #FFF8EE {
                    node "notification-audit-pod" as pod_notification <<executionEnvironment>> #FFF8EE {
                        artifact "bank-usac/notification:<git-sha>\nNestJS" as image_notification
                    }
                }

                node "frontend-service" as svc_frontend <<kubernetesService>> #EAF2FF
                node "gateway-service" as svc_gateway <<kubernetesService>> #EAF2FF
                node "customer-service" as svc_customer <<kubernetesService>> #EAF2FF
                node "account-service" as svc_account <<kubernetesService>> #EAF2FF
                node "transaction-service" as svc_transaction <<kubernetesService>> #EAF2FF
                node "payment-service" as svc_payment <<kubernetesService>> #EAF2FF
                node "notification-audit-service" as svc_notification <<kubernetesService>> #EAF2FF

                node "Namespace resource" as namespace_resource <<executionEnvironment>> #EAF2FF
                artifact "ConfigMap/bank-usac-config" as configmap
                artifact "Secret/bank-usac-secrets" as secret <<secret>> #FFF0F0
            }
        }
    }

    node "kubectl port-forward\nlocalhost:3000 -> svc/gateway\nlocalhost:3010 -> svc/frontend" as portforward <<executionEnvironment>> #EAF2FF
    artifact "Helm chart\ninfra/k8s/helm/bank-usac" as helm_chart
}

' UML deployment dependencies: artifacts are deployed to execution environments.
image_frontend ..> pod_frontend : <<deploy>>
image_gateway ..> pod_gateway : <<deploy>>
image_customer ..> pod_customer : <<deploy>>
image_account ..> pod_account : <<deploy>>
image_transaction ..> pod_transaction : <<deploy>>
image_payment ..> pod_payment : <<deploy>>
image_notification ..> pod_notification : <<deploy>>
 rabbit_image ..> rabbitmq : runs as
 customer_db_image ..> customer_db : runs as
 account_db_image ..> account_db : runs as
 transaction_db_image ..> transaction_db : runs as
 payment_db_image ..> payment_db : runs as
 notification_db_image ..> notification_db : runs as
 minio_image ..> minio : runs as
helm_chart ..> namespace_resource : <<deploy>>\nhelm upgrade --install
configmap ..> pod_frontend
configmap ..> pod_gateway
configmap ..> pod_customer
configmap ..> pod_account
configmap ..> pod_transaction
configmap ..> pod_payment
configmap ..> pod_notification
secret ..> pod_gateway
secret ..> pod_customer
secret ..> pod_account
secret ..> pod_transaction
secret ..> pod_payment
secret ..> pod_notification

' Kubernetes Service selection and host exposure.
svc_frontend --> pod_frontend : selects / forwards
svc_gateway --> pod_gateway : selects / forwards
svc_customer --> pod_customer : selects / forwards
svc_account --> pod_account : selects / forwards
svc_transaction --> pod_transaction : selects / forwards
svc_payment --> pod_payment : selects / forwards
svc_notification --> pod_notification : selects / forwards
portforward --> svc_gateway : HTTP\nlocalhost:3000
portforward --> svc_frontend : HTTP\nlocalhost:3010

' All application-service broker traffic is asynchronous AMQP over the explicit host gateway.
' The communication path is bidirectional because services publish and consume messages.
pod_gateway <--> rabbitmq : AMQP/TCP 5672\nhost.docker.internal
pod_customer <--> rabbitmq : AMQP/TCP 5672\nhost.docker.internal
pod_account <--> rabbitmq : AMQP/TCP 5672\nhost.docker.internal
pod_transaction <--> rabbitmq : AMQP/TCP 5672\nhost.docker.internal
pod_payment <--> rabbitmq : AMQP/TCP 5672\nhost.docker.internal
pod_notification <--> rabbitmq : AMQP/TCP 5672\nhost.docker.internal

' One service owns one database; there is no shared database.
    pod_customer --> customer_db : PostgreSQL/TCP\nhost.docker.internal
    pod_account --> account_db : PostgreSQL/TCP\nhost.docker.internal
    pod_transaction --> transaction_db : PostgreSQL/TCP\nhost.docker.internal
    pod_payment --> payment_db : PostgreSQL/TCP\nhost.docker.internal
    pod_notification --> notification_db : PostgreSQL/TCP\nhost.docker.internal
    pod_gateway --> minio : S3-compatible/TCP 9000\nhost.docker.internal
    pod_customer --> minio : S3-compatible/TCP 9000\nhost.docker.internal

note right of docker
    RabbitMQ, MinIO and all five PostgreSQL databases run as Docker containers
    on the developer host, outside the kind cluster.

    Deployment properties (not node identities):
    RabbitMQ container: rabbitmq | AMQP: 5672 | management: 15672
    Customer DB: customer-db | database: bankusac_customer
        user: customer_user | host mapping: 5433
    Account DB: account-db | database: bankusac_account
        user: account_user | host mapping: 5434
    Transaction DB: transaction-db | database: bankusac_transaction
        user: transaction_user | host mapping: 5435
    Payment DB: payment-db | database: bankusac_payment
        user: payment_user | host mapping: 5436
    Notification DB: notification-db | database: bankusac_notification
        user: notification_user | host mapping: 5437
    MinIO: minio | S3 API: 9000 | console: 9001

    The preferred route is a shared Docker network plus selectorless
    Kubernetes Services with stable in-cluster DNS. The host.docker.internal
    labels shown on the paths are the documented local fallback.
end note

note bottom of kind
    Local deployment uses one kind worker node. This is not a production
    high-availability topology; replicaCount starts at 1 for the project.
end note

note right of namespace
    Kubernetes-specific properties shown as annotations:
    Each KubernetesDeployment starts with replicas = 1.
    Frontend and Gateway are exposed with kubectl port-forward.
    The five internal Services use ClusterIP.
    ConfigMap stores non-sensitive runtime configuration.
    Secret stores JWT, database and RabbitMQ credentials;
    secret values are not versioned.
    Dashed dependencies from ConfigMap and Secret represent
    runtime references from the Kubernetes Pod specifications.
end note

@enduml
